{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 XY Pad by Tech Audio\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Bad case of too many FX params and not enough hands? There's a pad for that!\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Getting Started\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Make sure ReaImGui is installed (available through ReaPack)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Run XY Pad - you'll be greeted with some instructions on how to add mappings and configure your experience.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Add some mappings, and drag the cursor across the pad - eyes wide, watching those param values sing.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab Sit back, close your eyes and ponder the new sonic horizons you've opened up.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Join our community!\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/fCnkP9PhTQ"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
Discord
}}}
\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Crossfader by Tech Audio\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Suffering from repetitive strain injury fading between media items? Crossfader!\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A simple window will pop up and ask you for the fade duration and shape. REAPER currently provides the following fade shapes:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Linear\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Slow Exponential\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Slow Logarithmic\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Fast Exponential\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Fast Logarithmic\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Slow Sine\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Fast Sine\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Getting Started\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Make sure ReaImGui is installed (available through ReaPack)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Run Crossfader\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Select two or more media items (even across multiple tracks)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab Adjust the fade duration and select the shape\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 5.\tx360\tab Click "Go" or hit Enter\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 6.\tx360\tab Reclaim all your saved time - maybe start that podcast about rare birds of the Pacific Northwest?\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Join our community!\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/fCnkP9PhTQ"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
Discord
}}}
\sa180\par}
}

