{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 REAPER scripts from the Tech Audio nerds at Team Audio\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Audio software by audio people for audio people!\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 We're the Tech Audio group, a handful of the team members from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://teamaud.io"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
Team Audio
}}}
 at-large.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 You can find a few handy scripts in the FX category in our repository here - more to come!\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Beyond those, we've got some other projects out there and cooking - keep an eye on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://techaud.io"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
TechAud.io
}}}
 for the latest news, releases & developer notes. We're learning a lot and looking forward to sharing.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Got ideas for scripts or plugins that you think would be great community resources? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/fCnkP9PhTQ"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
Come hang out with us
}}}
 on discord!\par}
}
